{"unit_id":"cdxiaodong__dsh-guardian#card-zh","repo":"cdxiaodong/dsh-guardian","commit":"c667e06686a7ef67ed79df6502e18aedf8a8319d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-guardian 是面向 DSH 的 Cordis 插件，为 agent 工具调用提供前置检查与审计记录。它注册 guardian/check 和 guardian/path 事件，可组合内置规则、文本扫描和路径校验，并允许宿主接入 guardian/approve 人工确认。服务还支持自定义规则、查询近期审计记录及按配置调整检查项。适合希望在 DSH 工具调用流程中加入检查与审计接口的使用者；无需额外 API 密钥，运行时会在用户主目录写入审计日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:53-84","src/index.ts:97-130","src/index.ts:154-168"]}
{"unit_id":"cdxiaodong__dsh-guardian#card-en","repo":"cdxiaodong/dsh-guardian","commit":"c667e06686a7ef67ed79df6502e18aedf8a8319d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-guardian is a Cordis plugin for DSH that adds tool-call checks, path validation, and audit records. It provides guardian/check and guardian/path hooks, host approval, custom rules, and recent audit lookup. No API key is configured; audit output defaults to a file in the user home directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:53-84","src/index.ts:97-130","src/index.ts:154-168"]}
